  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Chicken chorizo sizzles up with sunny, smoky flavor as seasoned chicken cooks with paprika, garlic, and a gentle kick of cayenne. Sweet bell peppers and onions join the pan, then a splash of chicken broth and a touch of apple cider vinegar pull everything together with bright, savory depth. Ready in about thirty minutes, this easy skillet turns a regular weeknight into a mini celebration. Finish with creamy avocado and fresh cilantro for a fresh, comforting bite that keeps everyone coming back for more.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-chicken-chorizo\">Why You’ll Love This chicken chorizo</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-chicken-chorizo\">How to Make Chicken Chorizo</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-chicken-chorizo\">Pro Tips for Making Chicken Chorizo</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-chicken-chorizo\">How to Serve this chicken chorizo</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-chicken-chorizo\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This chicken chorizo</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Quick and easy to make in just 30 minutes.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Packed with bold, spicy flavors that excite your taste buds.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Versatile dish perfect for weeknight dinners or meal prep.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Healthy protein option that keeps you satisfied.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Great for customizing with your favorite veggies!</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-11430\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"11430\" data-servings=\"4\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe wprm-re